## Account

Push as **hamagama**. **Medfathallah** gets 403 Permission denied on this repo. `gh` is often not on PATH. WinGet binary: `%LOCALAPPDATA%\Microsoft\WinGet\Packages\GitHub.cli_Microsoft.Winget.Source_8wekyb3d8bbwe\bin\gh.exe`. If that `gh` user is not hamagama, run `gh auth switch` to hamagama.

Git Credential Manager is stored as Medfathallah, so a plain `git push` sends the wrong account. Clear the helper for one command and pass a bearer header. Never print, log, or store the token.

```
git -c credential.helper= -c http.extraheader="AUTHORIZATION: bearer $(gh auth token)" push origin HEAD:harmonization-modis-viirs
```

On this branch, `git push -u origin harmonization-modis-viirs` is the other allowed shape, with the same one-shot auth. Do not `git push origin main`.

